{% comment %}
  One place that decides whether a surface shows a price or says "Coming soon".

  Two independent switches, either of which suppresses the price:

    settings.store_coming_soon   theme-wide. Nothing in the shop is for sale.
    product coming_soon metafield  per product, for a staggered launch.

  Before this snippet existed the product card honoured the metafield but the
  two product-detail surfaces printed {{ product.price | money }}
  unconditionally, so flagging a product hid its button and left its price on
  screen. Route every price through here so those cannot drift apart again.

  Usage: {% render 'price-or-soon', product: product, class: 'price' %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign soon = false
  if settings.store_coming_soon
    assign soon = true
  elsif product.metafields.monkmanthra.coming_soon.value
    assign soon = true
  endif
  assign cls = class | default: 'price'
-%}
{%- if soon -%}
  <span class="{{ cls }} {{ cls }}--soon label">Coming soon</span>
{%- else -%}
  <span class="{{ cls }}">{{ product.price | money }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
